{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"delete","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Deleting stops the directory, and only that","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (§30.3 rule 5): directory accounts can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no longer sign in with a password – there is no fallback to a local hash – and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sync stops. Sessions, refresh tokens and passkeys those accounts already hold keep","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"working until they expire or the accounts are deactivated. There is no unlink: a linked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account stays a directory account.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"title":"delete()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK12DirectoryApiV6deleteyyYaKF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"delete"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/DirectoryApi"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/directoryapi\/delete()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DELETE \/api\/v1\/tenants\/{tenant_id}\/directory"}],